WEBVTT

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:21.170
Okay, kids! I'm Uramichi-<i>oniisan</i>.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.630
Hello!

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:27.130
Hello!

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:31.140
Wow, everyone joining me
today is so energetic!

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.010
So much so that I wish I could suck all
that energy out of you! How wonderful!

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:38.480
Let's play together a lot today!

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.440
Okay!

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:48.650
Rather, this is a case where I'm the one
whose energy is getting sucked out.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:53.280
But the more energy, the better,
so this is good, kids!

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.950
Even my false cheerfulness
is better than nothing.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:00.370
This isn't where you should laugh.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.540
You're fine today,

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:05.090
but you'll surely have a day where
you can't help but feel less energetic.

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:07.710
And, on such a day,
you'll be forced to be "positive."

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:13.220
The word sounds nice, but "escapism" and
"dereliction of duty" are wrapped in it.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:16.600
Don't be confused by things like that.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:34.190
"Together with Maman"

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:48.600
"Life Lessons with Uramichi Oniisan"

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.730
Episode 2: Senpai and Kohai

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:20.510
Wednesday

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:28.100
Ugh... morning has come again...

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.940
Staff Only

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.440
Good morning!

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.700
Good morning!

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:44.160
Good morning.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.290
G'morning.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.910
G'morning.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.700
"Beware of Bear"   "Wanna Quit Bunny"

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.290
Morning!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:54.880
I'm more energetic at work than
the moment I got up this morning.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:58.260
It's like, you give up and go around in
a circle, and then you're having fun now.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:03.390
Ah... I kind of feel like
I can do my best today!

